// Smart Campus Network Simulation
// This project simulates a campus network with multiple subnets:
//   - Student Subnet (4 PCs)
//   - Teacher Subnet (2 PCs)
//   - Admin Subnet (2 PCs)
//   - Server Farm (Campus Server)
// Connected via a core router with QoS-based traffic prioritization.
